1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,083
In six weeks, NVIDIA lost $2 trillion in market value.

2
00:00:04,403 --> 00:00:05,748
That’s more than all of Meta.

3
00:00:05,928 --> 00:00:07,269
Not cash. Paper value.

4
00:00:07,589 --> 00:00:08,710
Why so valuable?

5
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:11,849
NVIDIA makes about 8 in 10 AI chips.

6
00:00:13,469 --> 00:00:17,576
This year, Big Tech plans to spend $700B+ on AI.

7
00:00:17,756 --> 00:00:19,273
NVIDIA sits at the center.

8
00:00:19,843 --> 00:00:20,828
Then, three shocks.

9
00:00:21,008 --> 00:00:23,097
Voters backed limits on new data centers.

10
00:00:23,277 --> 00:00:26,160
Investors questioned NVIDIA funding its own customers.

11
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:30,123
And CEO Jensen Huang stepped down amid a board investigation.

12
00:00:30,443 --> 00:00:34,789
From a record $5.77T to $3.76T.

13
00:00:34,969 --> 00:00:36,308
Down 35%.

14
00:00:37,528 --> 00:00:38,762
Sales are still growing.

15
00:00:38,942 --> 00:00:41,669
So, is this an AI bubble, or market panic?

16
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:44,330
Follow InvisiTech.

